# getPostsForChannelAroundLastUnread + getEditHistoryForPost + getChannelMembersTimezones —
# 2026-09-04. Every line is `api`: all three oracles are the cross-server comparison.
#
# Patterns were checked for the harness fault the reactions/emoji plan found — `mutate.sh`
# replaces the FIRST occurrence, so a pattern that also appears in a doc comment rewrites prose
# and is scored a survivor. Several of these needed multi-line anchors because the file now holds
# four `ORDER BY p.createat DESC` and three `if !allowed {`.
#
# name<TAB>file<TAB>from<TAB>to<TAB>suite<TAB>filter
#
# Two behaviours are deliberately **not** in this plan, because both are unobservable through
# their route and a mutation on either would survive for a reason that is not a test gap:
#
#   - `posts.reverse()` in `get_posts_around`. The after-window is read `CreateAt ASC` and walked
#     backwards, but `SortByCreateAt` re-sorts the whole list at the end, so the intermediate
#     order cannot reach a client.
#   - `post.reply_count = 0` in the same function. `processPost` zeroes it and the parents pass
#     immediately restores it — see the doc comment and
#     `channel_posts_unread::the_parents_pass_restores_the_reply_count_processpost_zeroed`.

